-----------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON DATASETS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT license above applies to the FloodLens source code only.

The preferred real-world dataset used by this project is:
  "Flood Risk in India" — https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/s3programmer/flood-risk-in-india
  License: CC0 Public Domain (no copyright restrictions).

When the real dataset is unavailable, FloodLens generates a synthetic
fallback dataset. The synthetic data is clearly labelled as synthetic in
the UI, in model metadata, and in documentation; it must not be presented
as real-world measurements.
